<div id="dedsecBody"><span aria-label="Main content" id="main" role="main"> <!-- NOTICE WRAPPER --><div aria-label="Notices" role="region" style="width: 100%;"><!--DOWNTIME NOTICE 
<p class="w3-pale-orange w3-border-bottom w3-border-top w3-border-amber" style="padding: 5px 16px 5px 10px;"><img alt="" height="19" src="/pubs/images/general/warnIcon.png" style="vertical-align: text-top; margin-right: 10px;" width="19" />Starting DAY, MONTH ##th at H:MM PM until about H:MM AM on DAY, MONTH ##th, our website will be unavailable during scheduled system upgrades. We recommend completing any online filings by 5:00 PM on MONTH ##th.</p>--> <!-- PAYMENT ISSUES 
<p class="w3-pale-red w3-border-bottom w3-border-top w3-border-darthmarr" style="padding: 5px 16px 5px 10px;"><img alt="" height="19" src="/pubs/images/general/errIcon.png" style="vertical-align: text-top; margin-right: 10px;" width="19" />We are experiencing issues processing payments. If you encounter issues please try again later.</p>--> <!-- WEATHER CLOSED-CLOSED 
<p class="w3-pale-orange w3-border-bottom w3-border-top w3-border-amber" style="padding: 5px 16px 5px 10px;"><img alt="" height="19" src="/pubs/images/general/warnIcon.png" style="vertical-align: text-top; margin-right: 10px;" width="19" />Our office will be closed on DAY, MONTH ##th, due to extreme weather conditions. Online services will be available. We will be reply to email and phone messages when we return on DAY, MONTH ##th.</p>--> <!-- WEATHER PHYSICAL OFFICE CLOSED STAFF WORK REMOTE 
<p class="w3-pale-orange w3-border-bottom w3-border-top w3-border-amber" style="padding: 5px 16px 5px 10px;"><img alt="" height="19" src="/pubs/images/general/warnIcon.png" style="vertical-align: text-top; margin-right: 10px;" width="19" />Our physical office location will be closed on DAY, MONTH ##th, due to adverse weather conditions. Online services will be available, and our staff will be working remotely to assist you via phone and email from 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM.</p>--> <!-- WEATHER LATE OPEN 
<p class="w3-pale-orange w3-border-bottom w3-border-top w3-border-amber" style="padding: 5px 16px 5px 10px;"><img alt="" height="19" src="/pubs/images/general/warnIcon.png" style="vertical-align: text-top; margin-right: 10px;" width="19" />Due to current weather conditions, our physical office location will open at ##:00 AM on DAY, MONTH ##th. We apologize for any inconvenience.</p>--> <!-- WEATHER PHYSICAL OFFICE CLOSED 
<p class="w3-pale-red w3-border-bottom w3-border-top w3-border-darthmarr" style="padding: 5px 16px 5px 10px;"><img alt="" height="19" src="/pubs/images/general/errIcon.png" style="vertical-align: text-top; margin-right: 10px;" width="19" />Our physical office location will be closed on Friday, November 8th, due to adverse weather conditions. Online services will be available, and our staff will be working remotely to assist you via phone and email from 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM.</p>--> <!-- END OF YEAR SYSTEM UPGRADE NOTICE 
<p class="w3-pale-orange w3-border-bottom w3-border-top w3-border-amber" style="padding: 5px 16px 5px 10px;"><img alt="" height="19" src="/pubs/images/general/warnIcon.png" style="vertical-align: text-top; margin-right: 10px;" width="19" /><strong>End of year site maintenance</strong> - From Wednesday, December 31st at 11:30 PM until Thursday, January 1st at 12:00 PM, our filing services will be unavailable during scheduled system upgrades.</p>--> <!-- HOLIDAY NOTICE 
<p class="w3-pale-blue w3-border-bottom w3-border-top" style="border-color: #C4C9EE!important; padding: 5px 16px 5px 16px;"><img alt="" height="19" src="/pubs/images/general/infoIcon.png" style="vertical-align: text-top; margin-right: 7px;" width="19" />Our office will be closed on Wednesday, November 11, in observance of Veterans' Day. <a href="https://www.coloradosos.gov/pubs/info_center/holidayCalendar.html">Holiday calendar</a></p>--></div></span>
